# Conformance

Conformance compares current evidence with canonical requirements.

In Minimal, this file may own individual findings. In Standard and
High-Assurance, `../machine-readable/findings.json` owns finding records and
this file owns assessment method, vocabulary, coverage, and summary.

## Classification vocabulary

- Conformant
- Compatible
- Transitional
- Nonconformant
- Absent
- Not Assessed
- Not Applicable

No project-specific conformance assessment has been completed.
